 "attestation": "Boundaries from Seshat Cliopatria (Bennett et al., Scientific Data 2025; CC BY 4.0), digitized from standard historical atlases at ~0.07° resolution. The Xiongnu's territorial extent is largely conjectural, reconstructed from Chinese annals (Shiji, Hanshu) describing tribute zones and campaign routes rather than surveyed boundaries; nomadic polities lacked fixed borders; low to moderate confidence for all frontier lines. Capsule researched for this polity/era specifically (confidence: high).",
